*> NEXUS-COBOL — boucles PERFORM inline + hors-ligne (banc N16)
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LOOPS.
AUTHOR. DGK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 I PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
01 SOMME PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 TOTAL PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 10
        COMPUTE SOMME = SOMME + I
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY "SOMME=" SOMME
    PERFORM CUMUL 4 TIMES
    DISPLAY "TOTAL=" TOTAL
    PERFORM CUMUL UNTIL TOTAL >= 12.
    DISPLAY "TOTAL=" TOTAL
    STOP RUN.
CUMUL.
    ADD 1 TO TOTAL.
